{"id":"n69671-1-9","stage":1,"title":"위쪽 · 上面","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69671-1-9-1","ko":"이 액자는 여기에 달까?","zh":"这个相框要挂在这里吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"액자는","meaning":"相框，镜框，画框","explanation":"액자：相框，镜框，画框；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"액자","audio":"/audio/ded7183e732eecbd4535.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66734","senseId":"1","lemma":"액자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"액자는","audio":"/audio/5750b86475c7162b1494.mp3"}},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에","audio":"/audio/89d8715c5ec0d5fb9df5.mp3"}},{"text":"달까?","meaning":"挂，悬，别，带","explanation":"달다：挂，悬，别，带；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64533","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달까","audio":"/audio/fd50db3df9d35c9b177b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ded7183e732eecbd","term":"액자","zh":"相框，镜框，画框","audio":"/audio/ded7183e732eecbd4535.mp3","entryId":"66734","definition":"装字画、照片等的框架。","pronunciation":["액짜"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"挂，悬，别，带","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"64533","definition":"将物品拴挂或插在某处，使其不掉落。","pronunciation":["달다"]}],"audio":"/audio/437fc4ff4706a5a339fc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69671-1-9-2","ko":"너무 낮은 것 같아. 좀 더 벽 위쪽으로 올려 달자.","zh":"好像太低了。我们把它往上挪到墙的更高处吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"낮은","meaning":"低，矮，低洼","explanation":"낮다：低，矮，低洼；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"낮다","audio":"/audio/066edc9ea6d8d3424666.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58155","senseId":"1","lemma":"낮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낮은","audio":"/audio/d6b1fe613ff31d9e7e05.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"벽","meaning":"墙壁，墙壁","explanation":"벽：墙壁，墙壁","readings":[{"term":"벽","audio":"/audio/a30f11b63eeef594e419.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28231","senseId":"1","lemma":"벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벽","audio":"/audio/a30f11b63eeef594e419.mp3"}},{"text":"위쪽으로","meaning":"上面，上方","explanation":"위쪽：上面，上方；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"위쪽","audio":"/audio/1b27b035fbbdec89403f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69671","senseId":"1","lemma":"위쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위쪽으로","audio":"/audio/d64b32e3ffb746b775e3.mp3"}},{"text":"올려","meaning":"拉上，卷上，拉起，提起","explanation":"올리다：拉上，卷上，拉起，提起；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"3","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올려","audio":"/audio/7451fed596c0e318c0ce.mp3"}},{"text":"달자.","meaning":"挂，悬，别，带","explanation":"달다：挂，悬，别，带；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64533","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달자","audio":"/audio/92f7429cb586794d1fa0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"066edc9ea6d8d342","term":"낮다","zh":"低，矮，低洼","audio":"/audio/066edc9ea6d8d3424666.mp3","entryId":"58155","definition":"由下到上的距离较短。","pronunciation":["낟따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"a30f11b63eeef594","term":"벽","zh":"墙壁，墙壁","audio":"/audio/a30f11b63eeef594e419.mp3","entryId":"28231","definition":"围绕房子或房间周围的部分。","pronunciation":["벽"]},{"id":"1b27b035fbbdec89","term":"위쪽","zh":"上面，上方","audio":"/audio/1b27b035fbbdec89403f.mp3","entryId":"69671","definition":"位于上部的位置或方向。","pronunciation":["위쪽"]},{"id":"ff5095d829513a79","term":"올리다","zh":"拉上，卷上，拉起，提起","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3","entryId":"22109","definition":"从下向上，使变高。","pronunciation":["올리다"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"挂，悬，别，带","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"64533","definition":"将物品拴挂或插在某处，使其不掉落。","pronunciation":["달다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bbbf2ef7072dafde768e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.512,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69671","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":53,"sequenceScore":2.3387,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这个相框要挂在这里吗？","好像太低了。我们把它往上挪到墙的更高处吧。","怎么抖得这么厉害？冷吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个相框要挂在这里吗？","好像太低了。我们把它往上挪到墙的更高处吧。","怎么抖得这么厉害？冷吗？"],"answer":1}]}
